1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:03,855
Every idea begins as a small spark.

2
00:00:03,855 --> 00:00:10,681
Here, a little light sets out through an unfinished world, looking for a place where it can become useful.

3
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:17,205
The first path is rarely the whole answer.

4
00:00:17,205 --> 00:00:19,901
A staircase offers another perspective.

5
00:00:19,901 --> 00:00:25,097
Step by step, the little light finds a direction it could not see from the ground.

6
00:00:29,017 --> 00:00:32,386
At the workshop, separate pieces start to fit together.

7
00:00:32,386 --> 00:00:38,991
Some move, some settle, and a rough possibility becomes something that can be tried and improved.

8
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:45,391
A useful idea needs a way to travel.

9
00:00:45,391 --> 00:00:52,107
A bridge connects the work to another place, carrying both the result and the lessons learned along the way.

10
00:00:56,017 --> 00:01:00,758
The light arrives in a garden, where its glow helps something new take root.

11
00:01:00,758 --> 00:01:05,035
What began as one small idea has become a place for others to begin.
